{
  "uid": "homelab-crypto-ambush",
  "title": "Homelab — Crypto Ambush",
  "description": "The three crypto-ambush bots: BingX (LIVE, unified combi 15m+1h, crypto_ambush), Bitmart (LIVE, combi, crypto_ambush_bitmart), Binance (SIGNAL-ONLY, crypto_ambush_signals). Trading performance from Postgres (amb_* tables), ops health from Prometheus (cambush_*), containers from cAdvisor, logs from Loki. Win/PnL semantics mirror the bot's own reports: resolved = FILLED + hit in (TP1,TP2,SL); wins = TP1+TP2; pnl_percent is the bot's bottom-line column.",
  "tags": ["homelab", "crypto-ambush", "trading"],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 2,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {"from": "now-7d", "to": "now"},
  "timezone": "browser",
  "annotations": {"list": []},
  "templating": {"list": []},
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "BingX live — bot",
      "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 0, "y": 0},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "(time() - container_last_seen{name=\"ambush-bingx\"}) < bool 120", "instant": true}],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {"type": "value", "options": {"1": {"text": "UP", "color": "green", "index": 0}, "0": {"text": "DOWN", "color": "red", "index": 1}}},
            {"type": "special", "options": {"match": "null", "result": {"text": "DOWN", "color": "red", "index": 2}}}
          ],
          "noValue": "DOWN",
          "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "red", "value": null}]}
        }
      },
      "options": {"colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "value"}
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "BingX live — open positions",
      "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 4, "y": 0},
